		<p class="mono rise d1" style="margin: 0; color: var(--acc)">404</p>
		<h1 class="h rise d2" style="margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.035em">Nothing to load here.</h1>
		<p class="lede rise d3">The lightest page is the one that doesn't exist. This one took it a bit too far.</p>
		<div class="rise d4" style="display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 32px"><a href="/" class="btn">Back home</a><a href="/work" class="btn2">See my work</a></div>
	</section>
</Base>

<style>
	.nf {
		padding-top: 120px;
	}
</style>
